#, php-format
msgid "MyWed Award %s"
msgstr "MyWed Award %s"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:4
#, php-format
msgid "We are eager to share with you a secret list of the MyWed Award %s additional nominations because less than a month is left before the start of the contest. But shhh!"
msgstr "我们渴望和您分享MyWed Award额外的%s个提名的秘密清单，因为离开比赛开始还有不到一个月的时间。但请您保密！"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:6
msgid "You can start uploading photos for each nomination to your portfolio right now to submit them to the contest when it is launched."
msgstr "您可以马上为每一个提名把照片上传至您的作品集，从而在比赛开始时可以提交照片。"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:8
msgid "Besides, this year we have a new prize for the winner of the \"Best Wedding Story\" nomination. The Photographer of the Year will take the Nikon Z7 II camera with Nikkor Z 24-70mm f/2.8 S lens!"
msgstr "但是，今年我们为“最佳婚礼故事”提名的获胜者提供了新的奖项。年度摄影师将获得Nikon Z7 II相机以及Nikkor Z 24-70mm f/2.8 S镜头！"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:9
#, php-format
msgid "%s nomination comprising single photos has the prize fund of %s."
msgid_plural "%s nominations comprising single photos have the prize fund of %s."
msgstr[0] "由单张照片组成的%s个提名共有奖金%s。"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:11
#, php-format
msgid "So, here go %1$s additional nominations of the MyWed Award %2$s:"
msgstr "那么，以下是额外%1$s个MyWed Award%2$s提名："

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:14
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:79
msgid "Conceptualize"
msgstr "概念化"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:15
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:80
msgid "Purely artistic images limited only by your imagination"
msgstr "只受到您的想象力限制的纯艺术照片"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:16
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:81
msgid "Houston, we have a problem"
msgstr "休斯顿，我们有一个问题"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:17
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:82
msgid "Situations when things go wrong"
msgstr "出错时的情况"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:18
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:83
msgid "Aesthetics"
msgstr "美学"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:19
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:84
msgid "The perfectionist mode on. Excellence in every aspect of the shot"
msgstr "完美主义者模式已开启。拍摄的每一方面都非常优秀"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:20
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:85
msgid "The in-between"
msgstr "中间"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:21
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:86
msgid "Transient, seemingly insignificant moments that add a special flavour to the story"
msgstr "为故事增添特别情调的短暂的似乎并不重要的瞬间"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:22
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:73
msgid "Somewhere Epic"
msgstr "史诗般的某个地方"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:23
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:74
msgid "Locations in all corners of the world destined for adventure seekers"
msgstr "世界上注定属于冒险探索者的所有角落中的外景拍摄场地"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:24
#: application/views/private_messages/categories.phtml:12
#: application/views/private_messages/categories2.phtml:7
#: application/views/scripts/translations/category.phtml:4
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:23
msgid "Kids"
msgstr "儿童"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:25
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:87
msgid "The youngest, cutest and funniest guests of the wedding"
msgstr "最年轻、可爱和有趣的婚礼宾客"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:26
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:75
msgid "Let's have fun"
msgstr "让我们玩得开心吧"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:27
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:76
msgid "A wedding is a great opportunity for hilarious challenges and mischiefs"
msgstr "婚礼是一次面对欢闹的挑战和恶作剧的好机会"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:28
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:77
msgid "Glances and looks"
msgstr "瞥见和看见"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:29
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:78
msgid "When no words needed to reveal what the eyes have already done"
msgstr "无需多言，因为双眼已经表达了一切"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:32
msgid "The results of the MyWed Award will have a strong influence on the rating of all photographers on MyWed as winners and finalists will receive notable rating points. So if you want to set a new trend in wedding photography or get noticed by people from all over the world, there is no better way than to achieve this with the help of the MyWed Award!"
msgstr "MyWed Award的结果将对MyWed上所有摄影师的排名具有重要影响，因为获胜者和决赛入围选手将获得极高的评级分数。因此，如果您想要在婚礼摄影中引领新潮流或者获得来自全世界人们的注意，没有比通过MyWed Award的帮助来实现更好的方法了！"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:34
msgid "The call for entries opens soon."
msgstr "参赛人召集即将开放。"

#: application/views/mail/about_award.phtml:36
msgid "Stay tuned as we have more news to share!"
msgstr "敬请期待，我们将有更多新闻与您分享！"

