#: application/views/private_messages/about_inspiration.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %s,\n\n"
"We have added to the website a new section named \"Inspiration\" so you could share your creative photo shoots of any genre.\n"
"This section is free for all photographers but has some unique features:\n\n"
"— Photos in the section are visible only for photographers\n"
"— Photos' rating in the Inspiration category doesn't influence your overall rating\n"
"— Uploading limit is equal for all types of profiles — 1 photo per day\n\n\n"
"We are eagerly waiting for your photos of sunsets, food, and cats :)"
msgstr "%s，您好！\n\n"
"我们已经为网站添加了一个名为“灵感”的新版面，这样您将可以分享您属于任何类型的创意照片。该版面对所有摄影师免费，但具有一些独特的特点：\n\n"
"— 在该版面的照片仅为摄影师可见\n"
"— 在“灵感”类别中的照片评级不会影响您的综合评级\n"
"— 上传上限对于所有类型的个人资料均相同——每天1张照片\n\n\n"
"我们热切期待能看到您的日落、美食和猫咪照片 :）"

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:2
msgid "Today, I would like to speak about our actions in expression of our solidarity with the people of Ukraine during this horrific time. I'm sorry for deferring it, but we wanted to do something more important than just words."
msgstr "今天，我想谈谈我们在这一可怕时期所采取的行动，以表示我们与乌克兰人民团结一致。很抱歉这推迟了一点，但我们想做点比口头说说更重要的事。"

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:4
msgid "MyWed is no longer a Russian company. We do not want our taxes to sponsor the \"special military operation\" (in Russia, you may face a prison term for calling it \"war\"). Therefore, we have registered a new company, MyWed Inc, in a jurisdiction outside of Russia. From day to day, we are waiting for the approval of the payment terminal in the USA. After that, not a cent of your money will enter the Russian financial system."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:5
msgid "The Russian legal entity will exist, however, for some time, as we need to fulfill our obligations to our employees. Our designers, developers, and translators found themselves in a difficult situation. Now there is no work for them either in Russia or abroad. Unfortunately, the sanctions have dealt a severe blow to the most progressive part of the Russian people who opposes Putin."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:7
msgid "In addition, the Russian company MyWed LLC owns the MyWed trademark in the UK and the US. It will take some time for the trademark to be transferred to the new company MyWed Inc. However, we will make all effort possible to reduce the delay."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:9
msgid "We moved the entire project's infrastructure outside of Russia. Your photos and personal data are stored exclusively in Europe and the USA on Google servers."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:11
msgid "As early as February 26, we renewed MyWed Pro accounts for all Ukrainian photographers for a year for free."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:13
msgid "Since today, for all photographers from Ukraine, MyWed Pro account will cost a nominal fee of $1. Forever and without any conditions. MyWed will be completely free for any Ukrainian photographer."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/about_ukraine.phtml:15
#, php-format
msgid "We are forced to reschedule the Wedding Award - %s It's a tough decision, but we don't think it's a right time for fun. We hope you understand and support this decision, too."
msgstr "我们被迫重新安排Wedding Award——%s。这是一个艰难的决定，但我们不认为这是一个寻找欢乐的合适时间。我们希望您理解并也支持此决定。"

