#: application/views/private_messages/announce_winners_award.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi, %s.\n\n"
"Here goes the long-awaited news!\n\n"
"Our honourable jury finished voting for the best photos and stories submitted for MyWed Award %s.\n"
"And we're pleased to announce the winners: %s\n\n"
"Thanks to everybody who sent photos to the contest and congrats to the winners!"
