#: application/views/private_messages/award.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %1$s,\n\n"
"If you think we could forget about MyWed Award — no way. We have just slightly moved it due to COVID-19. This year the call for entries lasts from November, %2$s till December, %3$s.\n\n"
"Meanwhile, let us unveil 3 new MyWed Award 2020 nominations so you could have your time to prepare:"
msgstr "%1$s，您好：\n\n"
"您以为我们忘记了MyWed Award——绝不可能。我们只是因应新冠病毒流行而稍作延期。今年的作品召集从11月%2$s日至12月%3$s日。\n\n"
"同时，我们将推出3项全新的MyWed Award 2020提名，以便您能有足够的时间进行准备："

#: application/views/private_messages/award.phtml:7
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:114
msgid "Zentality"
msgstr "禅之语"

#: application/views/private_messages/award.phtml:8
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:123
msgid "Elegant photos with perfect color and composition balance which creates the ambiance of calmness and bliss."
msgstr "拥有完美色彩与构图平衡的优雅照片，营造出宁静祥和的氛围。"

#: application/views/private_messages/award.phtml:10
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:116
msgid "Not So Simple"
msgstr "Not so simple"

#: application/views/private_messages/award.phtml:11
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:125
msgid "Shots made using tricky photographic and compositional techniques. Here are your most unusual shots that no one would manage to repeat."
msgstr "运用巧妙的摄影和构图技巧拍摄的照片。这些是别人无法复制的您最不寻常的照片。"

#: application/views/private_messages/award.phtml:13
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:115
msgid "In The Raw"
msgstr "原始之美"

#: application/views/private_messages/award.phtml:14
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:127
msgid "A true report free of sobby sentiments. Sincere feelings and emotions captured on the photos without extra gloss."
msgstr "不带悲伤情绪的真实报告。毫不矫情地在照片上捕捉到真实的感受与情感。"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce.phtml:2
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:202
msgid "Final frame"
msgstr "最后的照片"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce.phtml:3
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:203
msgid "This is the end. A stunning shot before closing credits"
msgstr "甜美的结局。谢幕前的一个精彩镜头"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce.phtml:4
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:205
msgid "From A to B"
msgstr "从A站到B站"

