msgstr "从前景到背景"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce.phtml:16
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:223
msgid "Paradoxes"
msgstr "似是而非"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce.phtml:17
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:224
msgid "When colors, poses, gestures, and objects unexpectedly coincide..."
msgstr "当色彩、姿态、手势和对象意外地不谋而合…"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce.phtml:18
#, php-format
msgid "We're happy to announce that annual %1$s is about to start soon! Submission period opens in less than %2$s months. As usual, we share with you the secret list of this-year additional nominations, here they are:\n\n"
"%3$s\n\n"
"Upload photos for nominations to your portfolio right now, and submit them to the contest when it begins. Stay tuned!\n\n"
"MyWed Team"
msgstr "我们很高兴地宣布，年度%1$s即将展开！提交期限将在不到%2$s个月内开始。与往常一样，我们与您分享今年的额外提名名单如下:\n\n"
"%3$s\n\n"
"现在即可把提名照片上传到您的作品集，并在比赛开始时提交参赛。请继续关注！\n\n"
"MyWed团队"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce_new.phtml:1
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:717
msgid "We've got hot news about the next MyWed Wedding Award! It's time to reveal 8 additional nominations, so you have time to prepare for the competition. But shhhh... it's a secret:"
msgstr "我们有关于下一届MyWed Wedding Award的热门消息！现在是时候揭晓另外8项提名了，这样您就有时间为竞争做准备了。但是嘘……这是一个秘密："

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce_new.phtml:3
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:252
msgid "Home Sweet Home"
msgstr "《甜蜜之家》"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce_new.phtml:4
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:253
msgid "When the interior itself tells its own story"
msgstr "室内的每一寸空间都在诉说着自己的故事"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce_new.phtml:5
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:254
msgid "Expressive Void"
msgstr "《留白之美》"

#: application/views/private_messages/award_announce_new.phtml:6
#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:255
