#: application/views/private_messages/black_friday.phtml:2
#, php-format
msgid "Here we come with a special treat for you, a \"can't miss\" sale for the Black Friday %1$s!\n"
" \n"
"Only now you can purchase the Pro membership subscription for a year with a %2$s discount. The offer is valid until %3$s.\n\n"
"Don't miss the chance, go to the subscription page right now: %4$s and become one of the Pro members for %5$s only!"
msgstr "我们在这里为您带来了特别优惠，一次针对黑色星期五%1$s“不容错失”的促销！\n\n"
