#: application/views/private_messages/changes_award.phtml:1
msgid "This year we expect a few changes in the MyWed Wedding Award rules that we'd like to tell you about."
msgstr "今年，我们计划对 MyWed Wedding Award 的规则作出一些变更并希望能告知您。"

#: application/views/private_messages/changes_award.phtml:3
msgid "First of all, now not only MyWed PRO users will be able to participate in the contest — we're opening free participation as well. However, it won't allow submitting photos or series in all nominations, but only in any two, except for the main nomination Wedding Photographer of the Year."
msgstr "首先，现在不仅 MyWed PRO 用户可以参加比赛——我们还将提供免费参与机会。但是，这并不允许参赛者在所有提名中提交照片或系列，而只能在除了“年度婚礼摄影师”主提名以外的任意两个提名中进行提交。"

#: application/views/private_messages/changes_award.phtml:5
#, php-format
msgid "This year we will have two nominations for the best series instead of one. In addition to the Wedding Photographer of the Year, we suggest the Love Before and After the Wedding — for stories about couples in love. A series must consist of 25 to 45 photos to participate in this nomination. The winner will get a prize of %1$s, and 10 finalists will receive %2$s for the next 12 months."
msgstr "今年我们将有两项最佳系列提名，而不只是一项。除了“年度婚礼摄影师”，我们还推荐“婚礼前后的爱情”——关于热恋情侣的故事。一个系列必须包含 25 至 45 张照片才能参加此提名。获胜者将获得 %1$s 奖金，10 名决赛选手将获得接下来 12 个月的 %2$s 福利。"

#: application/views/private_messages/changes_award.phtml:9
msgid "Additional single-shot nominations will now be open to photos taken during the last 3 years (instead of 2 years for the main nominations)."
msgstr "额外的单张照片提名现将面向在过去 3 年（而不是主要提名的 2 年）拍摄的照片开放。"

#: application/views/private_messages/changes_award.phtml:11
msgid "The contest opens in September, but you can already upload your competition photos to your MyWed portfolio so that you can simply submit them to the contest when it starts accepting entries."
msgstr "比赛将于 9 月开始，但您已经可以将比赛照片上传到您的 MyWed 作品集中，这样就可以在比赛开始接受参赛作品时向比赛提交照片。"

#: application/views/private_messages/cost_services.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %s,\n\n"
"Be aware that currently your profile isn't displayed in the directory when the price filter is set.\n\n"
"Please specify the hourly rate in your profile. Thanks to it, a couple, who is looking for a photographer in your city or country using the price filter, will be able to see your portfolio in the directory.\n\n"
"You can set the price per hour on the page of the personal info settings: %s"
msgstr "%s您好，\n\n"
"请注意，目前您的个人资料在设定价格过滤器时不会显示在目录中。\n\n"
"请在您的个人资料中指定每小时价格。由于这样，使用价格过滤器寻找来自您的城市或国家摄影师的夫妇将能够在目录中看到您的作品集。\n\n"
"您可以在个人信息设置页面上设置每小时价格：%s"

#: application/views/private_messages/crashed_emails.phtml:1
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:986
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %1$s,\n\n"
"We have noticed that the email specified in your profile doesn't work (our emails bounce back to us).\n\n"
"Please set a correct email address on the personal info editing page: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s您好，\n\n"
"我们注意到您在个人资料中指定的电子邮件无法使用（我们的电子邮件被退回给我们）。\n\n"
"请在个人信息编辑页面中设置正确的电子邮件地址：%2$s"

#: application/views/private_messages/error_site.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %1$s,\n\n"
"We have noticed that %2$s — the website set in your profile is unavailable for a long time yet.\n"
"Probably you forgot to pay for hosting, or the website contains errors. Please check it."
msgstr "%1$s，您好：\n\n"
"我们注意到%2$s——在您个人资料中设置的网站长期无法访问。\n"
"可能您忘记了支付托管费用或者网站包含错误。请对此进行检查。"

#: application/views/private_messages/family_award_finishing.phtml:2
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:960
#, php-format
msgid "Hi, %1$s.\n\n"
"Every minute counts! Kindly note that the %2$s will soon stop accepting submissions. The contest deadline is the %3$s.\n\n"
"Find out all information about the %4$s, including nominations descriptions and rules on the competition page: %5$s\n\n"
"Hurry up to submit your photos!\n\n"
"Wishing you lots of luck!"
msgstr "你好，%1$s ！\n\n"
"每一分钟都很重要！请谨记，%2$s很快将会停止接受作品提交。比赛截止日期为%3$s。\n\n"
"了解关于%4$s的所有信息，包括比赛页面上的提名说明和规则: %5$s\n\n"
"赶紧提交您的照片吧！\n\n"
"祝您好运！"

