msgstr "选择该类别作为您的强项后，激活它并指定您的拍摄价格。"

#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/photographer.phtml:12
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:198
#, php-format
msgid "Then you must upload %s photo to your portfolio otherwise our editors won't review it and make it visible in the directory."
msgid_plural "Then you must upload %s photos to your portfolio otherwise our editors won't review it and make it visible in the directory."
msgstr[0] "随后您必须上传%s张照片至您的作品集，否则我们的编辑将不会对它进行审核以及让它显示在目录中。"

#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/photographer.phtml:15
msgid "Your profile will not be visible to anyone except our editors until it is approved.\n\n"
"The approval process can take up to 3 business days. Please be patient.\n\n"
"If everything is ok you will receive the message about your profile approval. If something is wrong you will receive a message with instructions to follow."
msgstr "在通过审核前，除了我们的编辑外，任何其他人将无法查看您的个人资料。\n\n"
"审核过程需3个工作日。请耐心等候。\n\n"
"如果一切正常，您将收到关于您的个人资料批准的信息。\n\n"
"如果某些方面出错了，您将收到关于应遵循的指引的消息。"

#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/photographer.phtml:21
#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/videographer.phtml:24
#: application/views/private_messages/set_about_languages.phtml:12
#: application/views/private_messages/set_about_languages2.phtml:9
