#: application/views/scripts/translations/category.phtml:163
msgid "We have become witnesses of an unprecedented crisis in the wedding industry caused by COVID-19. Many talented photographers stopped doing what they love and lost the source of income for their families.\n\n"
"Of course, it will not be like that forever. We are certain that in some months the world will return to its routine course. However, we understand that not all of you can wait so long. Besides, we can't guarantee a second pandemic wave won’t occur, and weddings might remain prohibited for some time. In any case a diversification seems a good idea.\n\n"
"So we have decided to go for radical changes to let the website cover other topics: kids, family, portrait photography, vacation and travel photo shoots.\n\n"
"If you already work in these fields, you can now create a relevant portfolio on MyWed. If not, maybe it's the right time to try, as a talented person is talented in everything : )"
msgstr ""

