#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:174
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:105
msgid "Daniel and Raquel"
msgstr "Daniel Monteiro和Raquel Pratas"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:176
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:108
msgid "Matthew Sowa is an internationally renowned, award-winning New York City wedding photographer. The \"Photographer of the Year\" 2019 by Master Photographers of North America, Top 10 Fearless Photographers 2018. His energy, creativity and a combination of photographic artistry and journalistic approach define his style."
msgstr "Matthew Sowa是享誉全球、屡获大奖的来自纽约市的婚礼摄影师。他曾荣获Master Photographers of North America颁发的2019年“年度摄影师”、2018年Fearless Photographers前10名。他的活力、创意以及对摄影艺术和纪实方法的结合很好了创造他自己的风格。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:178
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:109
msgid "Kristof is recognized in various photography associations: Top 100 Fearless Photographers, Top 30 This is Reportage and Masters of Wedding Photography. The best Belgian photographer on MyWed and a four-time finalist of the MyWed Award in the \"Photographer of the Year\" nomination. A jury member of several international contests. Kristof prefers a documentary style in shooting and tries to find beauty in ordinary situations."
msgstr "Kristof在多个摄影协会中获得了认可：Fearless Photographers前100名、This is Reportage前30名以及婚礼摄影大师（Masters of Wedding Photography）。他是MyWed上最优秀的比利时摄影师以及是四次MyWed Award“年度摄影师”提名的决赛选手。他曾担任多个国际比赛的大赛评委。Kristof更喜欢纪录片风格的拍摄并尝试在生活点滴中寻找美。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:180
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:110
msgid "Elena is recognized by the most important wedding photography associations: Top 10 Fearless Photographers and This is Reportage, Top 5 AGWPJA and WPS in 2019. A finalist in 3 single shot nominations and in the \"Photographer of the Year\" nomination of the MyWed Award 2019. Elena is a speaker at international conferences, a teacher, a mentor and an unrivaled wedding photographer from Greece whose photos are distinctively vivid and emotionally charged."
msgstr "Elena在多个最重要的婚礼摄影协会中获得了认可：Fearless Photographers以及This is Reportage前10名、2019年AGWPJA和WPS前5名。她是MyWed Award 2019的3个单景照提名决赛选手并获得“年度摄影师”提名。Elena是来自希腊的国际会议发言人、教师、导师以及无与伦比的婚礼摄影师，其照片鲜明生动且充满感情。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:182
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:111
msgid "Ufuk turned his hobby into a career 14 years ago, and today he is ranked number 1 Turkish photographer on MyWed and finalist of the MyWed Award 2019 in 3 nominations. Ufuk considers wedding photography as a lifetime project. Hundreds of couples from 22 countries keep irreversible emotional or entertaining moments captured by Ufuk who is passionate about aesthetically documenting them."
msgstr "Ufuk在14年前将他的爱好转变为自己的职业，今天他是MyWed上排名第1的土耳其摄影师并且是MyWed Award 2019的3个提名中的决赛选手。Ufuk把婚礼摄影视为一个终生的项目。Ufuk热衷于以艺术的手法进行记录，在他的捕捉拍摄下，来自22个国家的数百对新人保留住了永恒的记忆和欢乐的瞬间。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:184
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:112
msgid "One of the best wedding photographers in Venezuela on MyWed. Finalist in the \"Bouquet Toss\" nomination of the MyWed Award 2019. Outgoing by birth, creative by nature. Passionate about color, symmetry, lights, shadows and good moments of life. Leonel's main goal is to become the best by nourishing himself with all the knowledge he gains in the process of shooting."
msgstr "在MyWed上最优秀的委内瑞拉婚礼摄影师之一。MyWed Award 2019的”婚礼抛花“提名决赛选手。他本性开朗，创意更是与生俱来。他热衷于色彩、对称、光线、阴影和生活的美好瞬间。Leonel的主要目标是要通过他在拍摄过程中获得的所有知识来滋养他自己，从而成为最优秀的摄影师。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:186
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:113
msgid "The record holder for participation in the finals in the \"Photographer of the Year\" nomination of the MyWed Award 2012 — 2016, 2018 and 2019. The first place WPPI 2019 in the \"Album Division\" category, the \"Best Wedding Photographer\" by White Awards and Wedding Awards in 2018. Attention to each detail and wow-effect by every image create special aesthetics of Igor’s vision. His works are distinguishable by a special aesthetics, their colors are easily recognizable at first glance."
msgstr "MyWed Award 2012-2016、2018以及2019的“年度摄影师”提名决赛参与的记录保持者。WPPI 2019的“相册专区”类别第一名、White Awards和Wedding Awards在2018年颁发的“最佳婚礼摄影师”。专注于每一处系列和每一张照片的热烈反响创造了Igor视觉的特别美学。他的作品因特别的美学效果而与众不同，其色彩让人一看难忘。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:188
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:114
msgid "Patrick is a talented photographer originated from Brittany, a French area. After the 10-year experience in photography, he is named Top 100 Fearless Photographers, This is Reportage and Top 20 Wedding Photography Select in 2019. Patrick thinks wedding photographers are \"junkies\": psychologically and physically drained by the end of a season with all the investment they give to work, they always strive for a new season to start."
msgstr "Patrick是来自法国布列塔尼地区的一名天才摄影师。在从事摄影10年之后，他在2019年荣获Fearless Photographers、This is Reportage前100名以及Wedding Photography Select前20名。Patrick认为婚礼摄影师就是“瘾君子”：在心理和生理上带着他们给予工作的所有投入在一个季度结束时被耗尽，他们总是在争取一个新季度的开始。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:190
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:115
msgid "Two pairs of eyes, two fingers on the trigger, one only heart! Menino Conhece Menina is a Portugal couple, Daniel and Raquel. Olives and architecture brought them together but photography became their path. They shoot in an emotionally genuine way: goosebumps, chattering eyes, tears of joy and happiness. Top 25 WPJA and Top 30 This is Reportage in 2018."
msgstr "两对眼睛，两只手指在触发器上，唯一一颗红心！Menino Conhece Menina是一对葡萄牙夫妇，Daniel Monteiro和Raquel Pratas。橄榄和建筑让他们相遇，但摄影成为了他们共同的道路。他们用真情实感进行拍摄：鸡皮疙瘩、含情脉脉的双眼、欢乐与幸福的泪水。他们在2018年获得了WPJA前25名和This is Reportage前30名。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:192
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:116
msgid "The \"Photographer of the Year\" of the MyWed Award 2019, the winner in the \"Heroes of the Day\" nomination and finalist in the \"Getting Ready\" nomination, Top 10 ISPWP in 2 nominations. \n"
"Christian focused on the contrasts of life, unforgettable moments and irreversible spontaneous situations that made him perceive his true love for photography."
msgstr "MyWed Award 2019“年度摄影师”、“每日英雄”提名获胜者以及“婚礼筹备”提名决赛选手、2次ISPWP前10名提名。\n"
"Christian专注于生活的对比、难忘的时刻以及永恒的瞬间——这让他找到了对摄影的珍爱。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:195
#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:118
msgid "A dynastic wedding photographer, friendly and chatty guy and a father of two. Shooting for about 10 years he sticks to a documentary approach. Professional and continuously learning he is included in Top 3 Masters of UK Wedding Photography, Top 5 This is Reportage 2020, named on the SLR Lounge UK Top 100 list, and Top 50 Fearless Photographers."
msgstr "继承祖业的一名婚礼摄影师，友好且健谈的一个人，两个孩子的父亲。从事摄影近10年，他始终坚持着纪实式的方法。专业且不断学习，他入围了Masters of UK Wedding Photography前3名、This is Reportage 2020前5名并获提名进入SLR Lounge UK前100名单以及Fearless Photographers前50名。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/competition_nominations.phtml:197
#, php-format
msgid "The jury panel this year includes such world-famous wedding photography experts as %1$s, %2$s, %3$s, %4$s, %5$s, %6$s, %7$s, %8$s, %9$s and %10$s."
msgstr "评审团小组今年包括有世界知名的婚礼摄影专家，例如%1$s、%2$s、%3$s、%4$s、%5$s、%6$s、%7$s、%8$s、%9$s和%10$s。"

