#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:61
msgid "Can you give a few tips for photographers who are just starting out?"
msgstr "对于刚入行的摄影师，您能提供一些建议吗？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:3
msgid "Viviana Calaón Moscova"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:4
msgid "Viviana Calaón Moscova was born in Buenos Aires. She is dedicated to the wedding, family, and documentary photography in Ecuador. Viviana is recognized by some of the most important Family Photography Associations in the world: The best Ecuadorian family photographer and Top 50 family photographers in the world on MyWed and also award-winning at Fearless Family Photographers. Her greatest passion and goal is to connect with people, she tells stories with soul, full of real and spontaneous moments with high emotional impact."
msgstr "Viviana Calaón Moscova在布宜诺斯艾利斯出生。她在厄瓜多尔专注于婚礼、家庭和记录摄影。Viviana获得了一些全球最重要的家庭摄影协会的认可：厄瓜多尔最佳家庭摄影师、MyWed全球前50家庭摄影师以及Fearless家庭摄影师奖项。她最大的热情和目标是要把人们联系起来，她用心灵讲述故事，充满真实和自发的瞬间，带来强烈的情感冲击。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:6
msgid "Olivier Bolte"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:7
msgid "Life is all about movement, colors, emotions, and carelessness…that's what Olivier is trying to communicate in his family pictures. Number 1 by Lifestyle Photographers in 2020, the best 2020 This is Reportage Family french storyteller, and Fearless Family awarded photographer, Olivier always tries to capture happy emotions, humor, and beauty in his family or pregnancy lifestyle shoots or in his documentary family sessions. Kids have become an endless source of inspiration since he started to photograph them 7 years ago. Father of 2 little guys, he knows how those monsters work."
msgstr "生活就是关于运动、色彩、情感和漫不经心……这正是Olivier尝试在他的家庭照片中所传递的。2020年生活方式摄影师第1名、最优秀的2020年This is Reportage Family法语故事作者以及Fearless Family获奖摄影师，Olivier总是尝试在他的家庭或孕期生活方式拍摄或者在他的记录家庭情景中捕捉快乐情绪、幽默和美。自从他7年前开始拍摄孩子以来，孩子们就成为了他不绝的灵感来源。作为2个孩子的父亲，他非常了解这些小怪兽。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:9
msgid "Theo Manusaride"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:10
msgid "With 13 years of experience as a professional photographer, Theo's commitment to documentary photography was rewarded by some of the most respected photography communities like Fearless Photographers, Fearless Family Photographers, This is Reportage and This is Reportage: Family, that also ranked her Top 30 documentary family photographers in the world and Top 5 in the Netherlands in 2020. In life, as well as in photography, she believes in honesty, supports authenticity, and strives for meaningfulness. She also believes that family photography shouldn't be a luxury and that every kid deserves meaningful memories of his childhood."
msgstr "拥有13年的专业摄影师经验，Theo对记录摄影的坚持获得了一些如Fearless Photographers、Fearless Family Photographers、This is Reportage和This is Reportage等最受尊重的摄影社团的认可：Family也将她列为全球前30名的记录家庭摄影师以及2020年荷兰的前5名。在生活中，以及在摄影工作上，她信仰诚实、支持本真并争取意义。她还坚信家庭摄影不应是一种奢侈，每一名孩子都值得保留其童年的包含意义的回忆。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:13
msgid "Kristof is recognized by various photography associations: he was ranked Top 10 family photographer by Inspiration Photographers and Top 10 family storyteller by This Is Reportage in 2020, and Top 10 family photographer by Fearless Photographers in 2021. He is the best Belgian photographer on MyWed and a jury member at This Is Reportage: Family in 2020. Kristof prefers documentary photography and tries to find beauty in ordinary things."
msgstr "Kristof获得了多个摄影协会的认可：他被Inspiration Photographers列为前10名的家庭摄影师、被This is Reportage列为2020年前10名的家庭故事作者以及被Fearless Photographers列为2021年前10名的家庭摄影师。他是MyWed上最优秀的比利时摄影师并且是This is Reportage的大赛评委：2020年Family。Kristof更喜欢记录摄影并尝试在普通事物中发现美。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:15
msgid "Evelen Torrens"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:16
msgid "Evelen Torrens started photographing professionally after the birth of her twin sons, Fernando and Miguel, who transformed her way of seeing and living life. With just 4 years of photography, Evelen was titled Family Photographer of the Year 2019 and the Most Awarded Family Photographer 2019 by Inspiration Photographers with 48 photographs in a single year - a new record for the entire association. Dedicated exclusively to family photography, Evelen brings a sensitive and insightful documentary look at small great moments of life, seeking simplicity and objectivity in family photographs. Her approach bases on respect for sentiment, truth, and responsibility for the importance that those records will have over the years."
msgstr "Evelen Torrens在她的双胞胎儿子Fernando和Miguel出生后开始从事专业摄影，他们改变了她生活和对待生活的方式。只有4年的摄影经验，Evelen被Inspiration Photographers授予2019年年度家庭摄影师以及2019年最具代表性家庭摄影师，她在一年内提交了48张照片——这是整个协会的新纪录。Evelen专注于家庭摄影，带来了生活中细微的伟大瞬间的敏感而深刻的记录，在家庭摄影中寻求简洁和客观性。她的方法基于对情感、真相的尊重，以及对这些记录在未来几年的重要性的责任感。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:18
msgid "Katrin Küllenberg"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:19
msgid "Katrin is a long-time family photographer and has been titled Top 1 Storyteller and Top 1 Photographer in Germany by This Is Reportage Family in 2020, and Top 1 Photographer in Europe in 2020 by FPJA. In her photos, she always looks for the special in the ordinary. She loves to play with light, color, and lines and shows her clients the drama and love in their daily family life."
msgstr "Katrin是一名长期的家庭摄影师，并在2020年被This is Reportage Family授予德国第1名的故事作者和第1名的摄影师，被FPJA列举为2020年欧洲第1名的摄影师。在她的照片中，她总是在平凡中寻找特别之处。她喜欢运用光线、色彩和线条，向客户展示他们日常家庭生活中的戏剧性和爱。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:21
msgid "Marisa Martins"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:22
msgid "I was born and raised near Lisbon, Portugal, and settled in the world of professional photography after several returns in my life — always good, always rich in experiences, and inspiring people. I went through the fashion area, worked as a model, and traveled across the world before I was twenty. Then I graduated from the university as a civil engineer and worked several years in project management. Only when my daughter Clara was born in 2012, I allowed myself to look for new horizons and found my greatest passion in family photography. Today, I wouldn't trade this life and my Canons for any other profession. Shooting the Day in the Life photo sessions, I try to gather more than images, I capture sensations closer to the experience of everyday life, I encapsulate memories, coated with feeling. This approach changes everything about family photography: it adds value to life, has a photographic record that guarantees feelings of happiness that we all can identify aesthetically and emotionally. Shooting the documentary family photography, I look for photographs that reflect life in a raw, more real, less peaceful, and less perfect way, approaching the real memories of childhood, contributing to everyday awareness of how incredible and interesting an imperfect family is."
msgstr "我在邻近葡萄牙里斯本的地方出生和成长，并在我的生活中多次来回后沉浸在职业摄影的世界——这总是美好的，总是充满经验，并鼓舞人心。在我20岁之前，我涉足过时尚圈，当过模特，周游世界。大学毕业后，我成为了一名土木工程师，从事了几年的项目管理工作。直到2012年我的女儿Clara出生后，我才让自己去寻找新的视野，在家庭摄影中找到了我最大的激情。今天，我不会用我的生活和佳能来交换任何其他职业。拍摄生活中的一天，我将尝试拍摄更多的照片，我捕捉更接近日常生活体验的感觉，我封装充溢着情感的记忆。这种方法改变了家庭摄影的一切：它增加了生活的价值，提供了摄影记录，保证幸福的感觉，我们都可以从美学和情感上进行识别。拍摄家庭纪实摄影，我寻找那些以一种原始的、更真实的、不那么平静的、不那么完美的方式反映生活的照片，接近童年的真实记忆，促进对一个不完美的家庭是多么的不可思议和有趣的日常的意识。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:24
msgid "Adam Riley"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:25
msgid "Hey, I'm Adam! I used to be a forensic scientist, but after falling in love with photography + storytelling, I left the scientific world and began my photographic career. Ten years later, I still love it! Father of two amazing little boys, Noah (7) and Lev (4), and husband to Laura! We love camping, cooking, cinema trips, and walking our labradoodle Quorra. It's a cliché, but it seems like only last week Noah was crawling around, only yesterday that Lev was born! Laura and I are keenly aware of time whirling past us and make every effort to savor the boys as they grow. I try to capture this daily growth for us to review in years to come, and I am rarely without a camera. I love to do the same for other families with my documentary portrait sessions."
msgstr "嘿，我是Adam！我曾经是一名法医科学家，但在爱上摄影+讲故事之后，我离开了科学世界，开始了我的摄影生涯。10年过去了，我仍然爱这个行业！作为Noah（7岁）和Lev（4岁）这两个了不起的小男孩的父亲，也是Laura的丈夫！我们喜欢露营、烹饪、看电影，还有遛我们的拉布拉多犬Quorra。这都是些陈腔滥调，但好像上个星期Noah还在到处爬行，而Lev昨天才刚出生！Laura和我都敏锐地意识到时间在我们身边飞逝，并尽一切努力在孩子们成长的过程中尽情享受。我尝试捕捉我们每一天的成长，以便我们能在将来回味，我几乎总是相机不离手。我喜欢用我的纪实人像系列为其他家庭带来同样的作品。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:27
msgid "Stanislav Khara"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:28
msgid "With 18 years of experience in wedding photography, he has captured over a thousand weddings across three continents and more than 15 countries. His passion for travel and meeting new people has been inspiring him to refine his professional skills over the years. Finalist of the Wedlife Wedding Awards 2015."
msgstr ""

