#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:43
msgid "Pete has achieved numerous accolades over the years which include multiple WPS Excellence, Fearless Photographers and ISPWP awards. He is currently ranked 2nd Fearless and 1st photographer on MyWed in the UK with 5th world ranked position with Wedding Photography Select."
msgstr "Pete多年来已经获得了众多荣誉，包括WPS Excellence、Fearless Photographers、国际专业婚礼摄影协会奖。他目前是排名第2的Fearless摄影师和MyWed上英国地区排名第1的摄影师，以及在Wedding Photography Select上世界排名第5。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:44
msgid "Member of the most prestigious wedding photographers associations: WPJA, AGWPJA, WPS, ISPWP, Fearless. 3rd place in AGWPJA 2016, Top 20 WPS 2016, TOP 10 in two categories of MyWed 2016, TOP 15 spring in ISPWP 2017."
msgstr "大部分著名婚礼摄影师协会的成员： WPJA、AGWPJA、WPS、ISPWP和Fearless。AGWPJA 2016第3，WPS 2016前20名，MyWed 2016两个类别中的前10名，ISPWP 2017春前15名。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:45
msgid "Brian and Allison are both Top Ten Fearless Photographers in the World with over 120 MyWed Editor's Choice Awards. With a full shooting schedule they still find time to teach and mentor fellow photographers."
msgstr "Brian和Allison均是在全世界超过120名的MyWed编辑精选奖项中排名前10的Fearless Photographers。在繁忙的摄影时间表以外，他们仍然能抽空为同行摄影师们进行教学和指导。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:46
msgid "Thoughtful, dynamic, cheerful, stubborn and resourceful couple from Italy. Damiano & Donatella have received a lot of recognition in the last years, here are some of them: Top 10 Fearless photographers in 2016, Top 10 AGWPJA in 2016, Top 10 Master of Italian wedding photography in 2016, Top 10 ISPWP fall 2016, Top 20 WPS in 2016."
msgstr "来自意大利的体贴、活跃、开朗、坚定和机智的一对夫妇。Damiano和Donatella在过去数年获得了充分的认可，以下是其部分荣誉：2016年Fearless Photographers前10名，2016年AGWPJA前10名，2016年意大利婚礼摄影大师前10名，2016年秋ISPWP前10名，2016年WPS前20名。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:47
msgid "Ross is one of the most prolific wedding photographers: Harper's Bazaar Official Recommended Wedding Photographer, Best Wedding Photographers in the World (Junebug), Best Wedding Photographer in England '13, '14, '15 & '16,  #1 UK Fearless Awards Winner '13, '14, '15 & '16."
msgstr "Ross是最高产的婚礼摄影师之一：Harper's Bazaar官方推荐婚礼摄影师，全世界最佳婚礼摄影师（Junebug），13、14、15和16年英格兰最佳婚礼摄影师，13、14、15和16年英国Fearless Awards获胜者。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:48
msgid "MyWed Photographer of the Year 2016, honoured Fearless and ISPWP member. Best Wedding Photographer 2015 in Russia (Wedding Magazine), Winner of the Wedisson Award."
msgstr "2016年MyWed摄影师，Fearless和ISPWP荣誉会员。俄罗斯2015年最佳婚礼摄影师（婚礼杂志），Wedisson Award获胜者。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:49
msgid "Member and award winner of Fearless Photographers and ISPWP. Currently one of the top 20 best photographers in the world on MyWed."
msgstr "Fearless Photographers和ISPWP。目前在MyWed上全世界最优秀的前20名摄影师之一。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:50
msgid "Magnificent Victor the Editors' Choice Conqueror. MyWed Top 10 in the World, winner of three nominations in the MyWed Award 2016. WPJA #2 in 2013, ISPWP #2 in 2013."
msgstr "编辑之选征服者的大赢家。MyWed全世界前10名，MyWed Award 2016三个提名的获胜者。2013年WPJA第2名，2013年ISPWP第2名。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:51
msgid "MyWed Photographer of the Year 2014. He has also received the Best of the Best award three years in a row by Junebug Weddings and the Photographer of the Quarter by the ISPWP."
msgstr "2014年MyWed摄影师。他已经连续三年获得Junebug Weddings颁发的至尊奖和ISPWP颁发的季度摄影师奖。"

