#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:63
msgid "A lover of good food, Belgian beer, photography, a bearded man and a father of 2 kids. Besides, Dries is the winner of the \"Details\" nomination of the MyWed Award in 2017. As a former graphic designer, he is always searching for a fresh angle, lines and a vantage point to create a modernistic graphic and geometric photographic style."
msgstr "一个美食、比利时啤酒和摄影爱好者，一个留胡子的男人和2名孩子的父亲。此外，Dries还是2017年MyWed Award“细节”提名的获胜者。作为一名前平面设计师，他总是能够找到新的视角、线条和有利位置，从而创造出现代化的图形和几何摄影风格。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:64
msgid "A fan of superheroes comics, cartoons and Lego, and a wedding photographer based in Tuscany, Italy. Top 5 WPJA 2014 – 2016, Top 5 ISPWP in 2016 and 2017, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2017 and Italian photographer of the year by ANFM in 2017."
msgstr "一个超级英雄漫画、卡通和乐高爱好者，一名以意大利托斯卡纳为基地的婚礼摄影师。2014-2016年WPJA前5名，2016和2017年ISPWP前5名，2017年Fearless Photographers前10名以及由ANFM评选出的2017年意大利年度摄影师。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:65
msgid "Currently, the best photographer in the UK according to MyWed. He was ranked the 1st photographer in the UK by Fearless Photographers in 2016, 2017 and by WPS in 2015, 2016. Among his other accolades: Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2016, Top 5 Wedding Photojournalist by MyMemory in 2017, and Best Wedding Photographer North West by TWIA in 2015."
msgstr "目前，根据MyWed的排名是英国地区的最佳摄影师。他是由Fearless Photographers评选的2016、2017年和WPS再2015、2016年英国地区排名第1的摄影师。他的其他荣誉包括：2016年Fearless Photographers前10名，由MyMemory评选的2017年Wedding Photojournalist前5名以及由TWIA评选的2015年西北最佳婚礼摄影师。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:66
msgid "Outstanding photo shooter from Indonesia, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2015 and 2016, ISPWP Photographer of the Quarter in 2015, Top 10 in 2015 and 2017. Hendra was the winner of Junebug Best of the Best Destination and Best of the Best Weddings in 2015, and a jury member of the Junebug Best of the Best Engagement in 2016 and of the 7th round of Master of Dutch Wedding Photography."
msgstr "来自印度尼西亚的杰出摄影师，2015和2016年Fearless Photographers前10名，2015年ISPWP季度摄影师，2015和2017年前10名。Hendra曾经是2015年Junebug Best of the Best Destination 和 Best of the Best Weddings的获胜者以及2016年Junebug Best of the Best Engagement和Master of Dutch Wedding Photography第7轮的评审委员会委员。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:67
msgid "Photographer of the Year by MyWed in 2017. Ken's sense of humour and vivacity are the main foundations for the emergence of his unique photographic style. The key credentials are Top 10 WPJA and WPS Photographer in 2017, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2016, Rangefinder and Junebug Best of the Best awards."
msgstr "由MyWed评选的2017年年度摄影师。Ken的幽默感和充沛精力是他独特摄影风格形成的主要基础。主要荣誉有2017年WPJA和WPS摄影师前10名，2016年Fearless Photographers前10名，Rangefinder and Junebug Best of the Best奖项。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:68
msgid "It is noteworthy that Jorge is a graphic designer, and the combination of the photographer's and the designer's skills allows him to create pixel-perfect images full of sincerity and artistic sophistication. The best Mexican photographer according to MyWed, he was honoured for the results of the MyWed Award in the previous years and is frequently awarded by ISPWP."
msgstr "值得注意的是，Jorge是一名平面设计师，摄影师和设计师技巧的融合使他能够创造出充满真诚和艺术般高雅的像素完美的照片。作为MyWed评选出的最佳墨西哥摄影师，他早年在MyWed Award上取得了优异成绩并经常获得ISPWP。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:69
msgid "Pavel has an eye for detail, and he knows fairly well when it is the right time to press the shutter. He was the finalist of three MyWed Award categories and currently has 4 Fearless Awards, being honoured by SLR Lounge as well. Pavel believes that one should incessantly work on self-enhancement to deliver top-grade photos to the customers."
msgstr "Pavel注重细节，他能相当好地知道何时是按下快门的合适时间。他是三个MyWed类别的决赛选手，目前拥有4个Fearless奖项，同时被评为SLR Lounge。Pavel相信，摄影师应该不断地自我提升以便为客户提供最优质的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:70
msgid "Candid photojournalism addict. He ranked the 4th best score in the Best Wedding Story category of the MyWed Award in 2017. Besides, he collaborates with White Sposa, Wedding Magazine and other publishing companies."
msgstr "真正的新闻摄影痴迷者。他在2017年的MyWed Award最佳婚礼故事类别中取得了第4高的分数。此外，他还和White Sposa、Wedding Magazine及其他出版公司保持着合作关系。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:71
msgid "Rising star in the wedding photography industry. With only 4 years into the game, he is named the Best Wedding Photographer of Belgium, Netherlands & Luxembourg by Masters of Wedding Photography in 2017, Top 10 of BeNeLux in 2015 and 2016, and Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2017."
msgstr "婚礼摄影行业的冒起之星。只是踏足这一领域4个年头，他就成为了由Masters of Wedding Photography在2017年评选的比利时、荷兰和卢森堡的最佳婚礼摄影师、2015和2016年BeNeLux前10名以及2017年Fearless Photographers前10名。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:85
msgid "Sara is a member of numerous associations and a winner of international and national contests by Fearless, ISPWP, MyWed and ANFM. She was the master of photography at the ProWedding Campus in Naples and a judge of the Romanian photographers' contest \"100 Fotografii de Nunta\" in 2018. She is constantly looking for a shoot with a strong emotive and creative impact."
msgstr "Sara是数家协会的成员和由Fearless、ISPWP、MyWed和ANFM主办的国际与国内比赛的获胜者。她是那不勒斯ProWedding Campus的摄影硕士和2018年罗马尼亚摄影师比赛“100 Fotografii de Nunta”的评委。她总是在寻求拍摄出带有强烈感情和创意冲击力的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:86
msgid "Cake eating, dog loving, wedding-obsessed chaser of emotions, moments, seductive colour and all the 'real stuff'. Masters the UK Wedding Photographer of the Year 2019, Fearless Photographers Judge 2018, Fearless Conference Speaker 2019, ISPWP Top Wedding Photographer in the UK in 2017, 2018, 2019. Published author of the photo journal \"The Last Role 3: How to Save a Life\"."
msgstr "吃蛋糕，爱狗，沉迷婚礼的情感追逐者，瞬间，诱人色彩和全部“真实材料”。2019年英国婚礼摄影师大师奖，2018年Fearless摄影师评委，2019年Fearless大会发言人，2017、2018、2019年ISPWP英国顶尖婚礼摄影师。摄影期刊《最后的角色3：如何挽救一条生命》出版作者。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:87
msgid "One of the best wedding photographers in China who likes capturing the candid moments of a wedding. He is honoured with countless accolades by various photography associations: Top 100 of WPJA in 2016, Top 50 of AG|WPJA in 2016, 2017 and Top 100 in 2018, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2018, Top 10 ISPWP Photographer in 2016, 2018, and the Grand Award of WPPI in 2018."
msgstr "中国最优秀的婚礼摄影师之一，喜欢捕捉婚礼的坦诚时刻。他获得了不同摄影协会的无数个奖励：2016年WPJA前100，2016、2017年AG|WPJA前50、2018年前100，2018年Fearless Photographers前100，2016、2018年ISPWP摄影师前10,2018年WPPI荣誉大奖。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:88
msgid "Leonard is one of the top documentary wedding photographers in the Netherlands. Recognised with national and international awards, he has top rankings with The Masters of Wedding Photography, Fearless Photographers, WPJA and This is Reportage. His aim in documenting weddings is to help couples remember and relive their wedding the best way possible – even to a level that their memories are preserved as art."
msgstr "Leonard是荷兰顶尖纪实婚礼摄影师之一。获得了国内和国际奖项的认可，他在The Masters of Wedding Photography、Fearless Photographers、WPJA和This is Reportage拥有顶级排名。他在记录婚礼时的目标是要帮助新人们以可能的最好方式记录纪念和重现他们的婚礼——甚至已经达到使他们的记忆保留成为艺术作品的水平。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:89
msgid "In his photos, he skillfully combines his personal shooting style, precise timing and emotional competence. Being a professional who is fascinated by everything that he does and sees around himself, he finds that people are a plentiful source of inspiration for him. He has twice been the finalist of the Mywed Award in the \"Photographer of the Year\" nomination."
msgstr "在他的照片中，他充满技巧地把他的个人摄影风格、精准的时间选择和情绪能力结合在一起。作为一名被他周围所做和所见的一切事情所吸引的专业人士，他发现人们是他丰富的灵感来源。他两次成为了MyWed Award“年度摄影师”提名决赛选手。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:90
msgid "A shy guy with a sharp eye, Andreu is a full-time observer and he is always striving to capture the authentic side of the story. He grew up in Barcelona and studied photography at Goldsmith University in London. Currently, he is one of the Top 10 photographers in Spain by FDB, Top 20 in the world by WPS and a 7 times finalist of the MyWed Award."
msgstr "眼睛敏锐的害羞男人，Andreu是一名全职观察家，他总是在努力捕捉故事的真实一面。他在巴塞罗那长大并在伦敦大学金史密斯学院学习摄影。目前，他被FDB评委西班牙前10名摄影师之一、被WPS评委全世界前20名并7次成为MyWed Award的决赛参赛选手。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:91
msgid "A hotshot photographer from Mexico, Gustavo found his vocation while he was studying the career in cinematography. Passionate about travelling, horror movies, ramen and couple goals, he is the finalist of 4 nominations of the MyWed Award of the previous years and the \"Photographer of the year\" in 2018, famous for his vibrant, dynamic and emotionally charged photos."
msgstr "来自墨西哥的成功摄影师，Gustavo他在电影摄影职业生涯的时候找到了他的职业。热衷于旅行、恐怖电影、拉面和新人们的目标，他成为了前几年MyWed Award的4个提名的决赛参赛选手以及2018年“年度摄影师”，以他充满活力、动感和情感的照片而闻名。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:92
msgid "Top 3 Vietnam photographer on MyWed. Luan relishes in shooting ordinary people and finds real joy in their simple and peaceful yet, at the same time, exciting moments. Being a finalist of the MyWed Award 2018 in \"The Colour's Speech\" nomination, he is, quite literally, a true master of colour."
msgstr "MyWed上排名前3的越南摄影师。Luan很享受拍摄普通人并在他们简单、平静但同时令人兴奋的瞬间找到乐趣。作为2018年MyWed Award“色彩的演讲”提名的决赛参赛选手，他是名副其实的一名真正的色彩大师。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:93
msgid "A husband, a proud father of two beautiful girls and a photographer by passion. Pedro lives in Lisbon and spends his days leading a simple life surrounded by his family and friends, nice talks and vibes, good food and wine and always with a camera in his hand. Top 10 photographers in Portugal on MyWed."
msgstr "一名丈夫、两个美丽女孩的骄傲父亲和充满激情的摄影师。Pedro生活在里斯本并且把他的每一天都花费在简单的生活上，他的生活围绕着家人和朋友、友善的对话和气氛、精致的食物和美酒，并且总是手拿照相机。MyWed上排名前10的葡萄牙摄影师。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:94
msgid "A quiet but an interesting guy, Artur loves photojournalism. He is considered to be one of the best wedding photographers in Germany, always eager for the perfect moment and shot. He adores travelling, delicious food and street photography. Happily married for more than 14 years, Artur is a father of two boys."
msgstr "安静但有趣的一个男人，Artur热爱新闻摄影。他被认为是德国最优秀的婚礼摄影师之一，总是对完美的瞬间和拍摄充满渴望。他热爱旅行、美食和街头摄影。超过十四年前幸福地结婚，Artur是两个男孩的父亲。"

