"如果您认识拍摄婚礼视频的人士，并能向他们推荐MyWed，我们将十分感激。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:171
msgid "To this category, please upload photos taken particularly on wedding days. Pre-wedding photo shoots and photos of couples at dates and engagements should be uploaded to the Engagement category."
msgstr "对于此类别，请上传特别在婚礼日拍摄的照片。约会和订婚时的婚礼前照片和夫妇照片应上传至“热恋爱侣”类别。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:172
msgid "The category is devoted to photos showcasing lovely women who are soon to become mothers."
msgstr "该类别是专门为展示将为人母的可爱女人的照片而设。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:173
msgid "Photos of newborn babies and nursing infants are to be submitted to this category."
msgstr "新生儿和初生婴儿的照片应提交至此类别。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:176
msgid "To this category, only upload photos whose main subjects are children at least one year old."
msgstr "对于此类别，只应上传主体为至少一岁以上儿童的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:177
msgid "Photos from family photo shoots featuring relatives of different generations should be uploaded to this category."
msgstr "以不同世代的亲属为特色的家庭摄影照片应上传至此类别。"

