msgstr "似乎所上传的照片和您之前上传的一张照片相似或者一样。不欢迎重新上传相同的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:452
msgid "Photos are taken at different events"
msgstr "照片拍摄于不同的活动中"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:454
msgid "Series should consist of photos taken at the same photo shoot. Photos taken on different days are allowed only if they are linked by chronology, and have the same conceptual idea or participants."
msgstr "系列应该由在同一次照片拍摄中拍摄的照片组成。只有在和年代记以及具有相同的概念性想法或参与者有联系的情况下，才允许在不同日子拍摄的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:456
msgid "Low technical quality of the photo, poor composition, cropping, or conceptual idea. Please submit only the best photos."
msgstr "低技术质量的照片，构图不佳，裁剪，或者概念性想法。请只提交最优秀的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:458
msgid "The photos are identical or too similar. The pictures feature repetitive subjects, poses, locations, situations, etc."
msgstr "照片一样或者太相似。照片具有重复的主体、姿势、地点、情景等。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:460
msgid "Photos from workshops (even if you are the host) are not accepted."
msgstr "不接受来自工作室（即使您就是主持人）的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:462
msgid "Contact details in the profile description"
msgstr "在个人资料说明中的联系人详细信息"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:464
msgid "You have set contact details in your profile description. Please remove them from the section."
msgstr "您已在您的个人资料说明中设定了联系人详细信息。请从该部分中删除它们。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:466
msgid "Incorrect country"
msgstr "错误国家"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:468
msgid "The country set in your profile has to correspond to the country code of your phone number and your current location."
msgstr "在您的个人资料中设定的的国家符合您电话号码的国家代码和您当前的位置。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:470
msgid "Unavailable website"
msgstr "网站不可用"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:472
msgid "Unfortunately, at the moment of our test, your website was unavailable. Please check whether it works normally and if the address specified correctly."
msgstr "很不幸，在我们当前的测试中，您的网站不可用。请检查网站是否运作正常以及指定的地址是否正确。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:474
msgid "Suspicious profile"
msgstr "可疑的个人资料"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:476
msgid "Your profile seems suspicious. Probably, you have specified incomplete or wrong personal info."
msgstr "您的个人资料似乎很可疑。有可能是您指定了不完整或错误的个人信息。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:478
msgid "Studio profile"
msgstr "工作室资料"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:480
msgid "The profile holds a studio name or features works of several people. Please note that only personal profiles are allowed on MyWed."
msgstr "资料包含工作室名称或者多个人的作品。请注意，MyWed上只允许个人资料。"

