msgid "Videographers wanted"
msgstr "招募摄像师"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:304
msgid "Resolution of the video"
msgstr "视频解析度"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:306
msgid "Everyone enjoys watching beautiful videos in high quality and that is why the minimum acceptable resolution we encourage you to consider is Full HD (1080p)."
msgstr "每人都能够欣赏高质量的漂亮视频，这正是我们建议您考虑具有最低可接受解析度，即全高清（1080p）的原因。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:308
msgid "Authorship of videos"
msgstr "视频原创作者"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:310
#, php-format
msgid "It is considered that the author of a video is the person who filmed at least %1$s of it.<br>By sending a video to the MyWed Award contest, you confirm that you are its author.<br>It is permissible to use up to %2$s of the assistants' footage.<br>You also guarantee that there are no third-party objections against the participation of your videos in the contest."
msgstr "人们普遍认为视频的作者是至少拍摄了%1$s视频的人。<br>发送视频参加MyWed Award比赛，表示您确定您是其作者。<br>可以允许使用最多%2$s的助理镜头。<br>您同时保证任何第三方不反对您使用视频参加比赛。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:312
#, php-format
msgid "You need to be a MyWed member to take part.<br><a href=\"%s\">Sign Up</a> on MyWed, add %s videos to your portfolio and wait for the approval.<br>After being approved, you will be able to send your video to the contest.<br>Already a member? Simply choose a video from your portfolio."
msgstr "您必须成为MyWed会员才能参加。<br>在MyWed上<a href=\"%s\">注册</a>，添加%s个视频至您的作品集并等待批准。<br>获得批准后，您将可以发送您的视频参加比赛。<br>已经是会员？只需从您的作品集选择一个视频。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:314
msgid "Number of videos"
msgstr "视频数"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:316
msgid "You can submit one video to the contest.<br>The video should be at least 1 minute long."
msgstr "您可以提交一个视频参加比赛。<br>视频长度至少应为1分钟。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:318
msgid "The winner of the contest will get the title \"Videographer of the Year\" and the Nikon Z6 camera with Essential Movie Kit provided by our outstanding sponsor, the Nikon company."
msgstr "比赛获胜者将获得“年度摄像师”的称号以及由我们优秀赞助商Nikon公司提供的包括Essential Movie Kit的Nikon Z6相机。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:320
msgid "What videos should be submitted?"
msgstr "应提交什么视频？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:322
#, php-format
msgid "Only wedding videos are accepted.<br>Submit your %s videos."
msgstr "只接受婚礼视频。<br>提交您%s年的视频。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:324
msgid "What videos are forbidden?"
msgstr "哪些视频被禁止？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:326
msgid "Don't submit photo slideshows and videos bursting with special effects, clipart and animation.<br>Videos from workshops and staged events are not allowed."
msgstr "不要提交具有特效、剪贴画和动画的电子相册和视频。<br>不允许来自工作室和舞台活动的视频。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:330
#, php-format
msgid "Hi,<br><br>I'm happy to let you know that we have finally launched the service!<br><br>Please follow the link %1$s and complete the Sign Up form providing your contact details and the email address you are writing me from, specify your rate and connect to your Vimeo account. After you add %2$s videos, our moderators will check if everything is fine and you will be displayed in the directory. The Pro membership will be activated automatically."
msgstr "Hi,<br><br>I'm happy to let you know that we have finally launched the service!<br><br>Please follow the link %1$s and complete the Sign Up form providing your contact details and the email address you are writing me from, specify your rate and connect to your Vimeo account. After you add %2$s videos, our moderators will check if everything is fine and you will be displayed in the directory. The Pro membership will be activated automatically."

